window.products.push({"id":376016,"name":"Ausic 2021 Portable Fan Rechargeable,10400mAh Battery Operated Powered Fan, Outdoor Camping Fan with Light & Hook, Personal USB Desk Fan, for Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LZQ7zvb3L._AC_SL1357_.jpg","description":"⭐【8-36 Hours Battery Life】 The battery operated fan powered by a 10400mAh large-capacity battery, it can work continuously for 8-36 hours according to the wind speed after being fully charged. The rechargeable fan supports working and wireless use while charging, and 100% charging can be completed in 5 hours. Whether it is at home, office or outdoor, it is your first choice. Allows you to enjoy the cool breeze all day long. ⭐【Powerful but Quiet Wind】Our camping fan use professional high-performance brushless motor, one-touch stepless speed control button, it can rotate to the most comfortable wind speed according to your needs. The well-balanced fan blades ensure that the noise is as low as 30db, usb fan providing you with cool air circulation, while ensuring that you have a quiet experience without being disturbed. ⭐【3-Level LED Lights】The battery powered fan is designed with 3-level brightness LED lights, soft and non-glare light, designed to meet your outdoor lighting needs at night. No more worrying about running out of battery when you go out, our outdoor travel fan supports reverse charging, which can charge your mobile phone, GPS, iPod devices. It's a lifesaver during camping/travel and hurricane season and other emergency disruptions, making it the ideal companion for your outdoor activities! ⭐【270°Adjustable Angle & Hook Design】The portable tent fan supports 270° rotation adjustment, allowing you to get airflow from different directions. And with built-in foldable hooks, it can be better hung on tents, cars, branches, walls, outdoors and simply on a table at home or office. ⭐【Portable & Anti-Drop】The personal cordless fan is made of anti-drop PP material and impact-resistant shell, it is a professional outdoor device，Shapes designed for travel backpacks. As a desk fan, it's perfect for rooms and offices. You can use it for outdoor work such as camping, hiking, car maintenance, etc., Indoor places such as office, bedroom, family gathering, garden, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LZQ7zvb3L._AC_SL1357_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ausic","source_asin":"B0BVPYGD2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVPYGD2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVPYGD2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
