window.products.push({"id":376039,"name":"efo Large Wooden Scoop – Rustic Bathsalt Scoop - Multipurpose Wooden Spoon - Wood Salt and Spice Scoop – Stylish Wooden Candy Spoon - Washing Powder S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFzGCm4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE and EFFECTIVE Sometimes the simplest tools are the best for the job. Efo Wooden Scoop, there are no gimmicks – just a simple but beautiful and effective tool for scooping a wide range of loose products. Our wooden scoops for food are lightweight, sturdy, balanced, and high-capacity. It is easy to carry and store. Perfect shape and form for easy and comfortable handling. You will be truly amazed at how comfortable is to use this professional Wooden Scooper. MULTIFUNCTIONAL This large wooden spoon can effectively transfer a wide range of materials, such as fine powder products or other dry ingredients, for instance: beans, peas, corn, rice, nuts, sunflower seeds, coffee bean, cooking chocolate, sugar, spices, salt from salt pig, pepper, baking soda, bath salt, dry cats and dogs food. It can be used also as a birdseed scoop. Quality wooden material is nontoxic and harmless thus younger users are happy to use it in a wooden play kitchen for sensory plays and with colored sand in a tuff tray with a stand, play sand pit or messy play tray. PREMIUM WOOD MATERIAL Natural beech wood has unique features and was used for thousands of years as an excellent, food-safe material for various kitchen tools. Handy and convenient to use Efo Scoop also adds a touch of quaint rustic flair to any kitchen decor. Efo Wooden Scoop is durable and it will look beautiful on your kitchen worktop and on a wooden bath tray or bath table. Hand polished wooden scoops are also ready to be personalized for your next crafting project. Specification: efo Wooden Scoop – 1pcs size: 18cm (7.1\") 100% natural beech wood Hand wash only, not suitable for dishwashers! Please check if dimension is ok for you. You can always choose a different size or wooden spoon set from rich efo scoops sales offer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFzGCm4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFO","source_asin":"B01BU254XO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BU254XO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BU254XO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
