window.products.push({"id":376117,"name":"Knocbel Lifting Student Desk and Chair Set, Adjustable Height Children Home School Workstation with Side Hooks for 3-14 Years Old Kids (Pink and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FzWndv88L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Introductions: The appropriate height of tables and chairs is especially important for children, especially during their formative periods. This children's learning kit will provide a more comfortable learning environment for your child. The desktop and chairs are adjustable in height and can easily accommodate children of any age (3-14 years old). Desktop size is 60x40cm, suitable for writing, drawing, etc. The desktop has a separate pen slot, you can place a pencil or eraser. There is a hook on both sides of the table that can hang a backpack or water bottle. The seat and backrest of the chair are made of plastic for easy movement of children. This product is made of high quality metal and density plate, as well as plastic, durable and long service life. Vibrant blue embellishment allows your child to integrate more quickly into the learning atmosphere. Specifications: Desk 1. Material: MDF Board & Plastic 2. Color: Pink & White/Blue & White 3. Desktop Dimensions: (23.6 x 15.8)\" / (60 x 40)cm (L x W) 4. Table Drawer Interior Dimensions: (16.7 x 12.4 x 5.9)\" / (42.5 x 31.5 x 15)cm (L x W x H) 5. Table Height: (24.8-29.5)\" / (63-75)cm 63/66/69/72/75cm  6. Pen Slot Length: 6.9\" / 17.5cm Chair 1. Cushion Dimensions: (13.8 x 8.7)\" / (35 x 32)cm (L x W) 2. Backrest Dimensions: (13.8 x 6.7)\" / (35 x 17)cm (L x H) 3. Overall Height of Chair: (28.4-30.7)\" / (72-78)cm 72/75/78cm  4. Cushion to the Ground Height: (15-17.3)\" / (38-44)cm?38/41/44cm? General Information 1. Product Weight: 25.17lbs / 12kg Package Includes: 1 x Desk  1 x Chair 1 x Screw Kit 1 x L Shape Hexagon Screwdriver","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FzWndv88L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knocbel","source_asin":"B08B3VLJSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3VLJSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3VLJSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376118,"name":"SkySiesta SNUG Travel Pillow - Head Support with L Shaped, Fiber Filled Sides. Patented Design.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PbcP927fL._AC_.jpg","description":"The SkySIesta SNUG Travel Pillow is made up of two L-shaped ends filled with soft, non clumping fiber. The two sides are connected by fabric and when you lay your head on this fabric the bottoms of the Ls turn inwards providing support for the chin,. There is buckle that can be clicked and the strap tightened to keep the pillow snug. The Pillow is washable and comes with a stuff bag and eye mask. The bag can be attached to any piece of luggage. DIMENSIONS: Height of Ls - 11\", Top width - 4\". Bottom width: 8\". Bottom Height: 5\". Connecting strip: 9\" x 6.5\" Please Note: The two L-shaped side pieces only are fiber filled. The connecting piece is NOT fiber filled. It is simply two pieces of fabric sewn together. This pillow keeps the head from flopping forward or to the side. This is NOT a traditional U-shaped neck pillow. This is a uniquely designed pillow and is available in only one size. While it should work for most people it may not for others. Also, the pillow works by being snug and hence it may not work well with noise cancelling headphones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PbcP927fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SkySiesta","source_asin":"B01N6MJ3QI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6MJ3QI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6MJ3QI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
