window.products.push({"id":376186,"name":"Funny Blue Elegant Cross - Boy Religious Party Photo Booth Props Kit - 10 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-gealX1mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"10-Piece Funny Blue Elegant Cross Photo Booth Props Kit INCLUDES 10 boy religious arrow and speech bubble photo booth props, 10 wooden dowel sticks and stickers for assembly. EASY ASSEMBLY: Simply attach the printed DIY photo booth props to the wooden dowels with included adhesive and reinforcing stickers. PERFECT FOR ANY CROWD! Photo booth props are fun baptism, Christening, first communion, confirmation or baby dedication party supplies for adults and kids - everyone will love the funny sayings on these Blue Elegant Cross photo booth props. Take entertaining and shareable party photos while making memories with these funny photo booth props! BOY RELIGIOUS PARTY DECORATIONS: Many fun ways to use these cute photo booth props! Use as intended and take party photos to share; Add them to vases and floral arrangements as a fun religious centerpiece; Accent your baptism candy buffet by displaying them in apothecary candy jars; Adhere as direction arrows to walls and your guests to the baby dedication party! HIGH-QUALITY: Blue Elegant Cross photo booth props are professionally printed on thick cardstock paper. They will arrive cut out and ready to assemble with the included wooden dowel sticks and stickers. MADE IN THE USA: Funny Blue Elegant Cross - Religious Party Photo Booth Props Kit is designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in America.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-gealX1mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B07PSQVSJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PSQVSJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PSQVSJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376187,"name":"Zuri Furniture Lush Adjustable Height Brown Swivel Armless Bar Stool with Brushed Steel Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":217.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S2MB1WVxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The name says it all! The Lush Bar Stool combines lavish relaxation with a timeless style. The seat frame is generously padded with high-density foam and upholstered in premium, soft leatherette with channel tufting. The ludicrously comfortable seat is supported by a brushed stainless steel stem and trumpet base that swivels 360 degrees freely and includes a rectangular footrest that follows you all the way around. A gas lift adjusts the height and makes this stool the perfect fit for any countertop or bar height table. Extravagance never felt so good as with the Lush Bar Stool. Also available with a square flat base, round flat base, or with a polished chrome base finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S2MB1WVxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zuri Furniture","source_asin":"B0BVWTC13Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVWTC13Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVWTC13Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376188,"name":"GVsmart Automatic Soap Dispenser, 11.8oz. Touchless Foaming Soap Dispenser, 4-Level Adjustable Foam Volume, Rechargeable Hand Free Soap Pump with Sens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SyssaCIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Auto Foaming Soap Dispenser] Our hands free soap dispenser uses the accurate infrared motion and PIR sensor, can detect your hand accurately within 1.5~2.0\" and dispense foam quickly in 0.2s. The dish soap dispenser will stop dispensing immediately when your hands leave the sensor. If you need to take more foam twice, please move your palm and repeat [4 Adjustable Foam Level] Designed with 4-Level adjustable foam output, this bathroom soap dispenser can meet the different needs of children and adults(Green-Power on/0.5s; Blue-0.8s; Purple-1.1s; White-1.4s; Red-power off/low battery). Compared with liquid soap dispensers, this kitchen soap dispenser richer and thicker foam, which will help to save rinsed time, soap, and water [Compatible with Various Soaps] Touchless soap dispenser is suitable for most kinds of liquid. For foam soap, pour it into the tank and use it directly. For regular liquid detergents, please dilute the soap with water in a ratio of 1:4 first, and stir it well to get perfect foam. Comes with 11.8oz/350ml large capacity and transparent visible container, this smart soap dispenser can avoid frequent refills and allow you to easily see the left liquid [1200mAh Extra Long Standby Time] Rechargeable electric soap dispenser with 3.0w USB charging cable, two hours of charging provides up to three months of standby time. The super battery life of this foaming hand soap pump is convenient plus saves the expense and hassle of replacing batteries [IPX5 Waterproof & Widely Used] The simple design of liquid and main engine separation. Easy to Install and secure to use. Allowing it to stay in damp conditions for a long time, such as bathroom, kitchen sink and toilet. And it also fit for hotel, hospital, office, and other places","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SyssaCIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GVsmart","source_asin":"B0BRS6CQ8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRS6CQ8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRS6CQ8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376189,"name":"LEIDFOR Tea Mug Tumbler Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle Tea Cup With Tea Leaf Filter Stainless Steel Leakproof Lid Handle 24-Ounce Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xCzyeQ84L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP HOT AND COLD FOR HOURS: double wall vacuum insulated coffee tea mug enables you to enjoy your hot coffee or iced beverages for hours FOOD QUALITY MATERIAL: 18/8 stainless steel interior, BPA-free plastic lid, SGS certified silicone rubber gasket and non-slip silicone bottom LEAKPROOF LID WITH HANLD: spillproof & it is convenient to have handle when your hands are occupied. NEW VERSION TEA LEAF FILTER: center hole for easily filling water without removing the filter. Concave rim on the center hole will filter the tea leaf away ( IMPORTANT: brewing the tea for at least 10 minutes) PORTABLE 24oz CAPACITY: 24 oz capacity for your daily need,also good for outdoor camping or traveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xCzyeQ84L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEIDFOR","source_asin":"B07G9DRPM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9DRPM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9DRPM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
