window.products.push({"id":376263,"name":"Digital Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z6e9iLkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Instant Read & Accuracy Ensure Perfect Result: Bosslife instant read digital meat thermometer measures temperature in 2-4 seconds with an accuracy of±0.2 °F (±0.1°C). No more waiting over a hot stove or grill for the temperature to settle and eliminate overcooked food, ensuring perfect result for beef, chicken, pork, fish, lamb, or turkey and also working great with beverages, deep frying, making candy, and baking. ✅Easy to Use with Auto on/off Function: Works right out the box with a built-in CR2032 battery! Pull out the probe and it turns on, push it back in and it turns off, 10 mins auto shut-off function extends your battery life. Temperature data can be locked on display so you don’t need to stay near the heat. And you can also calibrate the kitchen thermometer and know the max and min temperatures when cooking. ✅Long Probe & Backlightt LCD Screen: No hand burns anymore! The digital cooking thermometer with 4.72” stainless probe can detect the core temperatures in thin and thick food from any angle. And it won’t leave a large hole allowing the juices to leak out. The large dial with bright blue backlight means you can always read the temperature, whether you are grilling in the dark or cooking in a brightly lit kitchen. ✅Waterproof & Convenient: IP67 rated waterproof, so you don’t need to worry about steam, splashing, or cooking. With a strong ABS plastic body, the durable food thermometer can withstand accidental drops or other impact accidents. The BBQ thermometer with large hook allows for convenient storage and the built-in magnet which is super handy to keep it on the fridge or side of the grill. ✅Lifetime Warranty & Giftable Package: Your satisfaction is our priority. Enjoy a delightful product experience with LIFETIME WARRANTY. All materials of grill thermometer are completely safe and have undergone strict CE, FDA, RoHS Certifications. Comes beautifully packaged in a premium foam lined box, making it an ideal present for any cooking or BBQ enthusiast!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z6e9iLkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSSLIFE","source_asin":"B085VF4T8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085VF4T8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085VF4T8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
