window.products.push({"id":376339,"name":"honogo 20 oz Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler with Lid and Straw, Thermal Travel Coffee Mug with Handle, Keep Hot & Cold, Water Canteen, Beer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xJOnXQvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA BENEFITS FOR YOU Vacuum insulation The metal tumbler cup is constructed with double layers thermal insulated, keep your beverage stay hot and cold, retain your drinks temperature for long hours. Sweat proof, no condensation. Cool touch & burn free exterior. Flip lid with straw Splash proof lid, with flip top and straw hole. Stainless steel straw with silicone top, for better sip drinking. The lid also companiable with 20 oz Yeti rambler, Rtic, Ozark Trail tumbler. Food safe material This reusable tumbler cup is BPA free and complies with FDA standards. Food grade material, non-toxin; By this reusable cup, reduce using disposable drinkware, more eco-friendly. Portable design The to go coffee mug built with sturdy D-shape heavy duty handle for easy portability. A bonus carabiner, to attach bags and gears easily. Take your favorite drinks on the go with this tumbler mug. Perfect size 20 ounces(600ml). The slim base design it fit your car, truck, golf cart and boat cup holders. The tumbler mug is designed with wide mouth, Easy and quick cleaning and adding ice cube. Fits single-serve machines. Ideal for cold drinks, like ice Tea, iced coffee, beer; Also can serve as a big coffee mug, ideal for hot beverage like coffee, hot Chocolate. Maintain the ideal drink temperature to the very last drop. Giftable: The grip mug is a on the go warm gift for Christmas or Birthday；It's a nice tumbler gift also for mom, dad, sister, brother, freinds, women, men. USE AND CARE - Please wash with a dishwashing liquid and rinse thoroughly before first using.  - Never heat your tumbler in microwave or traditional oven.  - Please clean bottle in time when using for perishable drinks like milk.  - Dishwasher safe. Please place it on the top shelf to avoid potential damage from high temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xJOnXQvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"honogo","source_asin":"B09V1B849N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V1B849N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V1B849N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
