window.products.push({"id":376404,"name":"Green Bathroom Rug Cute Daisy Bath Mat White and Yellow Flower Decor Rugs Non Slip Floor Carpet Microfiber Bathmat Super Absorbent Machine Washable Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ycgS1wVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bright Color & Decorative: The green bath mat is brightly colored, has long-lasting color retention, green plush surface with white and yellow daisy, looks very cute and beautiful, involuntarily love it, especially suitable as a room decor rug. 3D Design & Soft Touch: The flower pattern of a cute bath mat is made through a masterful tufting process, the 3D effect can be maintained all the time. The cute rug is made of premium plush, and the plush is very tight, making the surface of the light green rug has a certain tension, soft and comfortable to the touch. Super Absorbent & Non Slip Backing: The plush is dense and thick, very comfortable to step on, has good absorbent performance, keeps your feet dry, and protects your floor. The green bathroom rugs are backed with TPR material, have excellent non slip properties, strong and durable. Please place the bath rug on the dry floor, and keep the bottom of the floor carpet clean and dry to ensure the safety of family members when using it. Machine Washable & Non-Shedding: QJHOMO bath rugs are machine washable repeatedly, recommend using cold water and mild detergent, and tumble dry at low speed or hang dry, still looks like a new bath mat. Every plush is firmly fixed at the backing with an excellent weaving process, don't worry about the plush of the green rug falling off. Applicable: 16 x 24 inches flower rug can be applied to most home areas, such as the bathroom, shower, tub, apartment, living room, doorway, kitchen, hallway, bedroom, and balcony. The flower bath mat looks really nice, great as a gift for family and friends at Christmas, Mothers Day, Fathers Day, Valentine's, and Wedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ycgS1wVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QJHOMO","source_asin":"B0BBGF49GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBGF49GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBGF49GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
