window.products.push({"id":376451,"name":"Zz Pro Potato Slicer Food Grade Stainless Steel 10W Electric Potato Tornado Slicer Automatic Cutter Machine Spiral Potato Cutter Twister Spiral Zucchi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBNvftfyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Electric Potato Tornado Slicer Automatic Cutter Machine Twister Spiral Cutting Machine for Slicing Twisted Potato Chips  Introduction  This is a fully stainless steel constructed potato slicer which is designed for slicing twisted potato chips. The Potato Twister Chips (also called, tornado potato, twisted potato, twisted fries, twisted chips or spiral potato) is a delicious fried potato on a stick. It's a great product to sell in parks, stadiums, restaurants, hotels, shopping malls, or, simply try your hand selling out of a local festival booth, streets or expand your current business selling spiral potato  Because of its economic advantage, it is very popular by the people. You can serve your customers or guests with the twist chips in different tastes by adding different flavors. This potato chips spiral cutter is a great product to use at home, restaurants and hotels  Technical Parameters  Power: 10W  Voltage: 110V   Rotated Speed: 90 runs/min  Cuts spirals about 1/8\" thick  Material: Stainless Steel  Occasion: Restaurant, Cake Room, Kitchen, etc  Features  Sell it at carnivals, concessionaires, parks, etc. Low maintenance; skid-proof rubber feet for safe operation. Produce by sturdy stainless steel construction which allows hands-free automatic operation.  Great for making twisted potato chips, tornado potatoes, and veggie snacks, etc.  Beside potato, it is also suitable for yam, radish, cucumber, taro and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBNvftfyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZzPro","source_asin":"B07CTJ2B32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTJ2B32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTJ2B32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
