window.products.push({"id":376531,"name":"Vivflavor Insulated Wine Bag Carrier - 2 Bottles Leakproof Padded Wine Cooler Bags Tote with Adjustable Shoulder Strap for Travel, Picnic, BYOB, Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TfQzrD5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥂【Padded & Well Insulated】:This wine tote is manufactured with internal foam padding, which protects bottles from shock, maintaining them safe during transit. The leakproof interior PEVA layer is resistant to low temperature to keep your 2 bottle wine well chilled and prevent liquid permeating through and dirting the wine carrier. 🍷【Portable Design】:Features a sturdy handle and an adjustable shoulder with metal buckles of the wine carrier bag, suitable for different carrying style. Front small zipped pocket helps store bottles opener, tissues or keys. Perfect for any occasions you want a glass of wine such as parties, outdoor concerts and movies, sport events, celebration dinner. 🍸【Inside Divider】:Internal divider of the insulated wine carrier tote keeps two bottles separate and prevents crush with each other. The divider also can be folded back to turn into a large insulated bag for other things you need to keep cold. Size Reference: 10.6\" x 2.4\" x 14\" (L x W x H ) Fit with 2 standard wine bottles and 6 × 300ml cans of beverages. 🍹【Stylish & Durable】:Made from high-quality 600D polyester to ensure maximum durability and long term use. This wine bottle carrying bag will not be easily deformed, which is stylish yet durable. Let you carry wine or other drinks in a safe and elegant way. 🍾【Ideal Gift for Wine Lover】:Beautiful look and pratical design make the wine cooler bag suitable for male or female in all age wine lover. If your families and friends are wine lover who like to drink outdoors or share wine with others, they will happy to receive this wine carrier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TfQzrD5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivflavor","source_asin":"B0BLSP4M13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSP4M13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSP4M13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
