window.products.push({"id":376573,"name":"Boska Holland Cheese Board, European Ash Wood w. Polished Surface, Natural Bark, 16\" x 7\", Taste Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lQw0zmN+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cheese Board Bark ‘M’ Let’s get back in touch with nature with this beautiful ash wood board with a bark edge. If you’re looking for a natural, rustic touch to your presentation, this board is your new best friend. It’s polished to perfection, and it will definitely catch your guests’ eyes. Just make sure to grab a photo before your guests dig in! - ONE OF A KIND: Each board is a unique slice of an ash tree - RUSTIC DESIGN: Add a touch of nature to your presentation & delight your guests - POLISHED FINISH: The board has been polished so it is food proof and smooth - EASY TO CLEAN: The board will not absorb bacteria or odors thanks to the polished finish The fine art of cheese boarding A cheese board is delicious as a dessert or as a snack - there’s no right or wrong way to build one. Cover your bases and get one bloomy rind, one washed rind, one blue rind, one fresh, and one hard cheese. Or play on a theme - cheeses from a particular region or that are currently in season. Enrich your board with crackers, nuts, fruit, and dips. They’re appealing to the eye, but also to the taste buds. Size This board is 16.7” x 6.9” - large enough to present 3 to 4 cheeses. Maintenance This board is hand wash only - wood is not dishwasher safe. Use warm water and soap to rinse it off, and leave it to dry vertically so the board will not warp. A monthly rub of mineral oil will keep the wood looking great. About Boska Holland Cheesewares We love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it’s been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world’s only specialist in Cheesewares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lQw0zmN+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B082PL2XS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PL2XS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PL2XS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
