window.products.push({"id":376645,"name":"COSMOPLUS Box Spring Cover Twin/Twin XL Size,Premium Elastic Wrap Around,Alternative for Bed Skirt,Extremely Stretchy,Wrinke Resistant,Fits Box Spring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+lQVPV6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"95%polyester5%spandex PROTECT YOUR BOX SPRING from dust, pollen and dander by wrapping it in a snug-fitting Cosmoplus Box Spring Cover. Rendering your box spring impermeable to stains extends its usefulness, keeps it looking pristine and ensures you of the most restful sleep. HIGH-STRETCH MICROFIBER is a blend of 95% polyester and 5% Spandex fabrics. This offers a snug, non-slip fit on box springs as thin as 4” and as thick as 12”. Available in king, queen, full, full XL, twin and twin XL sizes, Cosmoplus can protect beds for an entire family. 360-DEGREE ELASTIC around the hem and deep, mitered corners combine to give your box spring a tight, sleek appearance. A must-have addition to your bed linens and bedroom decor, its form-fitting look helps to create a sleep space that is eye-pleasing and inviting. DURABLY CRAFTED with tear-resistant fabric and reinforced stitching, Cosmoplus Box Spring Protectors are designed to last for the lifetime of your box spring. Even when you move, leaving the cover in place will help shield your box spring from incidental damage and dirt. MACHINE-WASHABLE Cosmoplus Box Springs Covers resist fading and wrinkling for easy care. To maintain their like-new appearance, launder them in cold water with similar colors and then tumble-dry on low. Do not use bleach. The covers will emerge ready to protect your beds once again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+lQVPV6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSMOPLUS","source_asin":"B08C513D8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C513D8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C513D8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376646,"name":"SMALL STAR Dream Catcher Handmade LED Light Heart Shape Feather Design Dreamcatchers for Wall Hanging Decor Home Decoration Festival Gift - Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sDUhKp-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dream catchers was originated from the 18th century. Indians used it to capture the beautiful dreams and let the nightmares vanish with the appearance of the morning sunshine. They believed that the nights were filled with various dreams and only the dreamcatcher can filter the bad ones and bring them into sweet ones. 1. Product Information: ♥ Material: high quality flocking cloth + cotton thread + iron ring + feathers + wooden beads, etc; ♥ Size: About 6.7 inch (17cm) in diameter, 18 inch (46 cm) in length; ♥ Color: Pink feather dream catcher. 2. Product Features: ♥ The large dream catcher is handmade. Each process is woven by workers own rich weaving experience and knit such a uniform, perfect and rhythmic grid; ♥ The wooden beads are polished and treated with the color preserving paint. The design and color matching make the dream catcher looks exquisite and vintage; ♥ The pink dream catcher feathers are fumigated and then carefully screened to ensure that each feather is flawless and trimmed by the master; ♥ Because of its beautiful design and symbols, the dream catcher is a great gift idea for both adults and kids. The unique dream catcher will must make the space sweet and bring more happy; ♥ The feather dream catcher mobile waves beautifully and quietly in the air. It will not disturb you and it prays for peace and good luck with you. 3. Product Application: ♥ The large dream catcher is perfect for indoor and outdoor hanging, in bedroom, living room, in the window, on the wall, etc to decorate your house or for party and wedding decorations; ♥ It is a great festival birthday gift for your friends, families with best wishes to them. 4. Note: The dream catchers are pure handmade, so it is purely normal if there are little differences between each one. 5. Service: Please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sDUhKp-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMALL STAR","source_asin":"B08XM6MRZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XM6MRZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XM6MRZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
