window.products.push({"id":376719,"name":"GOOD & GRACIOUS 72 Inch Electric Fireplace with Mantle White Fireplace TV Stand with Adjustable Heat & Flame 1500W Freestanding Electric Heater for Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y8LGkrkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REMOTE CONTROL HEAT: It's easy to control the amount of heat this electric fireplace generates! Using the included remote control, you can adjust the heat output, or it can be turned off completely while you still enjoy the flame. The internal blower distributes the heat up to 200 square feet. AUTOMATIC TIMER FOR HEAT & FLAME: Schedule the time you'd like to have the indoor fireplace turn on and off. And, the brightness, size and color of the flame can be adjusted with the included remote control so you can have the perfect combination of heat and flame day and night. THERMAL SAFETY PROTECTION: Designed with safety in mind, there is an auto safety shut off sensor and thermal overload protection. The 6' electrical cord has a Type B electrical plug for a grounded connection. QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP: Made with engineered wood for ease of assembly, we recommend 2 people for the assembly process. Artificial coals are included for a realistic flame, and a front panel vent helps to promote airflow within the electric fireplace. FIREPLACE WITH MANTEL DIMENSIONS: With a large frame measuring 72.5\"W x 14\"D x 32\"H, this indoor fireplace will the the centerpiece of your home. The internal firebox is 23\"W x 17\"H and has a blower to distribute the heat evenly. Product weight is 122 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y8LGkrkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOOD & GRACIOUS","source_asin":"B0B3MH45FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MH45FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MH45FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":376720,"name":"Isaac Jacobs Clear Acrylic Serving Tray (16x20) with Cutout Handles, Spill-Proof, Stackable Organizer, Space-Saver, Food & Drinks Server, Indoors/Outd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-U1xZi6ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacob Clear Acrylic Serving Tray is more than just an ideal companion for your ottoman and a handy space-saving accessory to have in your house. It is a necessity for apartment living and it will de-clutter any countertop. Use this chic 16”x 20” tray to arrange and display remote controls, drink coasters, candles, magazines, or coffee table books. Whether you are serving snacks, drinks, and appetizers to guests; or carrying plates of cake for the family, this multi-use tray will do the trick. Host friends for wine and cheese on a summer weekend and entertain guests on the patio with your go-to tray. The tray’s sleek, clear design makes for a decorative addition to your kitchen counter, bedroom, bathroom vanity, or wherever you choose to use it. Made of high-quality acrylic, with stylish cutout handles, the tray’s see-through design blends into the décor of any room. This versatile server can be used as an organizer for your bathroom accessories and cosmetics, displaying cotton swab containers, apothecary bottles, and makeup items on a large bathroom vanity space. Organize your office supplies in the tray and work from your couch. Decrease clutter and bring order to the rooms that need it most. Go ahead and enjoy a cozy weekend morning of breakfast in bed, or bring your kids soup and grilled cheese sandwiches. Whether you are serving wine and cheese or nachos and beer, there is no need to worry about messes. The edges of the Lucite tray are sealed, so spilled liquid will not drip through the edges. Messes can be easily wiped away with a clean cloth or a damp paper towel. Trays of the same size are conveniently stackable to save space. There are six other sizes to choose from and these serving trays come in square, rectangular, and octagonal shapes. This tray is an ideal choice for a wedding present or a house-warming gift for a friend, but you will want to warm your home with one first. [Note: Do not use window cleaner on acrylic]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-U1xZi6ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B071XJRJFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071XJRJFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071XJRJFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
