window.products.push({"id":376739,"name":"ALLXNOX USB Desk Fan Table Fan Rechargeable 4 Speeds Levels 4000Mah Battery With Strong Airflow Quiet Operation For Home Office Bedroom Travel Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GmlANzfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☢4-Level Air Volume Regulation & Strong Wind： The table fan has adjustable 4-level air volume: light wind (super silent, sleep wind), weak wind, stroke and strong wind. Breeze is friendly to infants. Select the wind speed mode that suits you, and you can instantly reduce your body temperature in a sultry day. ☢Automatic Swing：The desktop electric fan is equipped with a 120° left and right swing function, which expands the air supply range. And can adjust the angle up to 90° up and down, so you can use it anywhere you like.The bottom of the fan is equipped with anti-skid pad to increase stability and prevent slipping. ☢4000mAh Battery & Long-term Use： Built-in 4000mAh lithium-ion battery. After charging, can carry it and use it wirelessly. When fully charged, it can run for up to 12 hours and help you sleep all night. It can work continuously for about 6 hours even in the maximum air volume mode. It adopts convenient USB charging mode and can be used everywhere, such as mobile phone battery, car charging USB port, computer USB port, etc. ☢Super Silent Design： The three blades of the oscillating fan ensure strong airflow, and the super silent design eliminates rotating noise. The minimum wind speed mode and the maximum wind speed mode operate between 20dB and 50dB respectively. Will not be disturbed by noise or interfere with your life while sleeping or working. ☢Removable Cover & Easy to Clean： The front cover of this mini fan is removable, just turn it to the left. Blades and housings can be easily cleaned. Therefore, at the end of summer, clean the dust and dirt on the blades so that they can be used comfortably next year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GmlANzfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALLXNOX","source_asin":"B0BWH926K9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWH926K9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWH926K9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
