window.products.push({"id":376863,"name":"ClickClix 40 Sets for Duvets - US Patent System (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IODpqzE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Content: 40 ClickClix sets + a FREE pair of SockFix socks and a ClickClix pack (ClickClix Adhesive and ClickClix size M) What does a set include? It consists of a 2 pieces set: the rim and the button with the ClickClix logo on it. The button fits in the ring by pressure and the fabric gets caught in the middle of the assembly without causing any damage, so it’s possible to remove it in the future if desired. The tool included allows an easy installation as it helps to apply more pressure with less effort. Setting up ClickClix: Place a ClickClix in every corner of the filling, looking for areas with less padding to make it easier. Usually, the sides of the duvet fillings do not differ, so it will not matter in which side we install the rings and the buttons, although we’ll try to place all of them the same way, so the buttons are on one side and the rings, on the other. We do the same with the cover: we place a ring+button assembly on every corner, trying to match their placement with the ones on the filling. Now it is important to place the button up, with the ClickClix logos on the visible side of the cover; the rings will be on the inside Next step is joining the upper ClickClix sets together and now we will be able to put the whole cover easily. Finally, we should join the two lower ClickClix sets so the filling doesn’t move inside the cover. You will no longer wake up midnight covered only with the cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IODpqzE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ClickClix","source_asin":"B01LYIIA5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYIIA5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYIIA5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
