window.products.push({"id":376893,"name":"Poedist 4 Pcs Bathroom Shower Curtain Set,Yellow Print Shower Curtain Bright Style Shower Curtain Sets with Rugs(Bath Mat,U Shape and Toilet Lid Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91L9hJZVz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bathroom Set&Shower Curtain Sets】This Leopard Print shower curtain set is made of environmentally friendly polyester fabric, which can make the water dry quickly and prevent water from splashing on the floor. The durable thick coral velvet bath mat is soft and comfortable, which can quickly absorb dripping water and help you keep it The floor is dry and tidy. 【Creative design】This Leopard Print shower curtain set adds charm to the bathroom. The enthusiastic Leopard Print pattern makes your bathroom instantly full of vitality and a sense of fashion. The shower curtain set uses high-definition pattern printing technology, rich in colors and vivid, Not easy to fade. Completely change your bathroom style and create a warm and comfortable bathroom experience. 【Good Sizes】Waterproof shower curtain size:71\"x71\" W, O shape toilet lid cover size: 18\"x15\"W, Non-slip flannel bathroom mat sizes: 30\" L X 18\" W, U shape rug sizes: 20\" L X 20\" W. This shower curtain has been improved, he is wider and thicker than other shower curtains on the market, more suitable for your needs for a variety of bathroom scenes. 【Easy installation】We give 12 hooks for free. No need to worry about how to install it. 12 reinforced head grommets, simple suspension; weighted bottom hem to maintain perfect drape; toilet seat cushion has a durable elastic band for fixing; the floor mat has a unique bottom dotting non-slip design that is not easy to move, ensuring safety. 【Tips for You】No.1-The fluorescent effect of the mobile phone or computer may cause a few color difference between the product picture and the actual product, which is a normal phenomenon, please forgive its existence. No.2- Due to the vacuum packaging, the mats has not returned to its original shape when the package is opened, please be patient for a few hours(4-6 hours).If the mats do not lay flat, soak and hang to dry them to solve the problem.Any questions please don't forget to contact us anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91L9hJZVz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poedist","source_asin":"B0BCJSW3HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-376893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJSW3HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJSW3HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
